> 1 How can i know the effects of a scroll? all the scrolls with the same name
> in the inventory have the same effect?

The effects of scrolls also depend on the buc (Blessed / Uncursed /
Cursed) status of the scroll. So even if it has the same name, the
effect will be quite different for a blessed scroll than a cursed one.

In addition, your current state while reading the scroll changes the
effect. If you are confused while reading a scroll then it generally
will have a different effect.

But if you have two scrolls with the same buc status with the same name
then they will have similar effects.

This is assuming, of course, that you haven't changed the names of
individual scrolls using #name.

For the full list of scroll effects read:
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/scrl-343.txt



